  "adaptation": [
    "MDX 1.6.22 compiled at build time, no runtime compiler. Original four packs directly bundled from fixed TS/JS source.",
    "Official mdx-deck 3.0.10 runtime source extracted from matching gatsby-theme-mdx-deck package. Original App reducer/register, Context, useSteps, slide splitting, Slide, Wrapper and keyboard/swipe step semantics retained. Gatsby URL transition replaced by memory index updates; print/presenter/overview/storage/network navigation not provided. Local previous/next buttons and progress output added for iframe discoverability.",
    "Theme barrel restricted to original base/nightOwl/vsDark and styling API; unused theme objects excluded. Original pure-code samples, all step metadata/focus ranges and two-column themes unchanged. System UI/monospace fonts replace font dependencies. No external images used.",
    "theme-ui 0.2.52 persistent color storage disabled. Dynamic constructor fallbacks in lodash.merge/function-bind/get-intrinsic disabled/replaced with static native-compatible equivalents; original CodeSurfer parser and animations unaltered.",
    "Reduced motion determined once at mount/bundle load: directly selects original target step without spring scheduling. Hidden unmounts original tree and pauses owned tasks; visible remount resets step. Final exit removes all owned listeners/timers/observers/React tree.",
    "Browser UI pixels, native font measurement, swipe and resize geometry unverified. DOM tests use explicit fixed geometry, not visual acceptance."
  ],
  "tooling": {
    "react": "16.14.0 satisfies original ^16.8.0/^16.10.0",
    "mdx": "1.6.22 build-only",
    "esbuild": "0.25.5 build-only",
    "jsdom": "26.1.0 test-only"
  }
